    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/extras/b654571a2316177c2dbac5f3e1a236ba.avif?t=1747229700\" data-has-big width=800 height=453 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CELESTIA AND THE CELESTIAL TOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestia was once a colorful and peaceful village where Sunny, a young and fearless adventurer lived, alongside Dante, her magical pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while Sunny was away on an expedition, the evil Purrphett and his minions attacked the village and captured all the inhabitants\u2019 pets, retreating to the Celestial Tower, a sanctuary once protected by the Guardians of Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon her return, Sunny found her village desolate and its people frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her brave companion Dante, the two set off toward the Celestial Tower, determined to defeat Purrphett and lift the curse that had befallen Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sunny and her pets as you climb the floors of the Celestial Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve elemental puzzles, find hidden treasures, and discover secret locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... Purrphett\u2019s minions are hot on your trail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic turn-based battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose your units and skillfully arrange their abilities in your spell bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move across the grid, charge your mana, and unleash your elemental power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play even when it\u2019s not your turn: perform parries and real-time boosts at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/extras/b654571a2316177c2dbac5f3e1a236ba.avif?t=1747229700\" data-has-big width=800 height=453 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CELESTIA AND THE CELESTIAL TOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestia was once a colorful and peaceful village where Sunny, a young and fearless adventurer lived, alongside Dante, her magical pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while Sunny was away on an expedition, the evil Purrphett and his minions attacked the village and captured all the inhabitants\u2019 pets, retreating to the Celestial Tower, a sanctuary once protected by the Guardians of Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon her return, Sunny found her village desolate and its people frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her brave companion Dante, the two set off toward the Celestial Tower, determined to defeat Purrphett and lift the curse that had befallen Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sunny and her pets as you climb the floors of the Celestial Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve elemental puzzles, find hidden treasures, and discover secret locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... Purrphett\u2019s minions are hot on your trail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic turn-based battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose your units and skillfully arrange their abilities in your spell bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move across the grid, charge your mana, and unleash your elemental power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play even when it\u2019s not your turn: perform parries and real-time boosts at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a journey with Sunny and her magical pets to conquer the Celestial Tower, a once peaceful domain now taken over by an enigmatic figure. Explore the dungeon, solve puzzles, and win turn-based battles with real time mechanics to lift the curse that looms over your village.",
